  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Ever since VRchat updated relatively recently (not this build number, but an earlier one I cannot remember) I've been having trouble opening too many menus, because the quest 1 will run out of memory. Also, worlds that used to work in previous versions, suddenly have stopped working, and makes the quest crash to home screen. I'm talking about a world that I know has not changed, as it's a world I have been working on and haven't updated it in a while.\n\nI know these things used to work before, but something about the current version of VRchat is preventing a lot of worlds from loading on the quest 1. This isn't just limited to worlds that I made, it's most worlds that I used to be able to load into on the quest 1, but now it seems I cannot.",
